<title>USA: Fleming Cos Q4 net climbs on higher margins.</title>
<headline>Fleming Cos Q4 net climbs on higher margins.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Okla. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleming Cos Ins said Thursday improved margins in its food distribution segment helped earnings rise sharply in the fourth quarter ended December 28.</p>
<p>The company posted net income of $10.3 million, or $0.27 a share, in the most recent quarter, up from $4.0 million, or $0.11 a share, one year ago.</p>
<p>Sales in the period slipped to $3.9 billion from $4.1 billion last year, the company said.</p>
<p>Fleming is a food marketing and distribution company.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1/2 at 16-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
